WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:06.480
Hi, Mystery Recapped here. Today I am&nbsp;
going to explain a Korean thriller film&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:16.320
called “Everyone is there.” Spoilers&nbsp;
ahead! Watch out and take care!
&nbsp;

00:00:16.320 --> 00:00:21.840
Lisa is a timid and shy sixteen-year-old. In&nbsp;
the opening scene, she is running down a hill&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:21.840 --> 00:00:27.040
in the middle of the woods. Her clothes are&nbsp;
torn and her face is covered in injuries.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:27.040 --> 00:00:30.960
Suddenly, she trips on a stair&nbsp;
and falls several feet below.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:30.960 --> 00:00:35.680
With her remaining strength, she begs&nbsp;
someone for help and falls unconscious.
&nbsp;

00:00:35.680 --> 00:00:41.200
In the following scene, Lisa is in the hospital.&nbsp;
The severity of her injuries is clearly visible&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:46.880
in broad daylight. Fortunately, a bypasser found&nbsp;
her in the woods and brought her to the hospital.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:46.880 --> 00:00:52.320
Outside, two police officers are discussing the&nbsp;
case. Judging by the previous bullying reports,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:52.320 --> 00:00:55.840
the cops are sure that Lisa was&nbsp;
bullied by the girls of her school.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:55.840 --> 00:01:00.880
But before advancing the case, they will&nbsp;
have to get an official statement from Lisa.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:00.880 --> 00:01:06.320
They have also tried to contact Lisa’s parents but&nbsp;
it turns out that her mother died a few years ago&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:06.320 --> 00:01:12.720
and her father is overseas. He is not involved in&nbsp;
her life and doesn’t care even if she dies. 
&nbsp;

00:01:12.720 --> 00:01:18.240
When she regains consciousness, the head&nbsp;
police detective, Mr. Kim introduces himself.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:18.240 --> 00:01:23.120
He asks her several questions about her health&nbsp;
and the incident that happened yesterday but&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:23.120 --> 00:01:28.240
Lisa remains quiet throughout the interrogation.&nbsp;
They are interrupted by her homeroom teacher&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:28.240 --> 00:01:34.160
Miss Lee. She urges the officer to go away and&nbsp;
let the girl rest for a while. Malice is clear&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:34.160 --> 00:01:39.040
in her intention when she tries to stop Lisa&nbsp;
from giving away who actually did this to her.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:43.680
Mr. Kim then notices three middle-aged women&nbsp;
in the doorway. They are the mothers of the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:43.680 --> 00:01:48.880
girls who are suspected of bullying Lisa. He&nbsp;
figures that they want to threaten Lisa or&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:48.880 --> 00:01:53.120
bribe her into not saying anything. 
He asks them to go away since they are&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:53.120 --> 00:01:57.680
legally not allowed to meet the victim but the&nbsp;
women are adamant. Their husbands are people&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:57.680 --> 00:02:02.160
with power and money which makes them believe&nbsp;
their daughters can get away with anything.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:02.160 --> 00:02:06.720
Mr. Kim states that their daughters were the ones&nbsp;
who called Lisa to the mountain but the mothers&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:06.720 --> 00:02:11.840
nonchalantly claim that the girls were just&nbsp;
hanging out. When the argument gets heated, Lisa&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:11.840 --> 00:02:17.440
asks them to go away because she wants to rest.
After the incident, the homeroom teacher Miss Lee&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:17.440 --> 00:02:22.320
meets the school principal. Both of them know&nbsp;
very well that Lisa was bullied. To save the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:22.320 --> 00:02:27.360
school’s reputation, the principal wants Miss&nbsp;
Lee to transfer Lisa to another school when she&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:27.360 --> 00:02:32.560
returns. He hides his corruption by pretending&nbsp;
to be worried about the bullies’ future. 
&nbsp;

00:02:32.560 --> 00:02:38.000
A few weeks later, Lisa recovers from the injuries&nbsp;
and can finally walk around. Mr. Kim has tried to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:38.000 --> 00:02:43.200
ask her about the incident several times in the&nbsp;
past week but Lisa hasn’t broken her silence.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:43.200 --> 00:02:47.520
Because of lack of proper evidence, the case&nbsp;
is handed to some counseling guidance teacher,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:47.520 --> 00:02:52.320
and the bullies are let free again.
One night, Lisa lets the negative thoughts&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:52.320 --> 00:02:56.560
get the best of her. She tries to commit&nbsp;
the unthinkable but has to stop when a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:56.560 --> 00:03:01.840
lady walks into her room. The lady is the&nbsp;
counseling guidance teacher, Miss So-mi. 
&nbsp;

00:03:01.840 --> 00:03:06.800
So-mi has seen a lot of students like Lisa&nbsp;
and helped them live after being traumatized&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:06.800 --> 00:03:12.000
by a similar incident. She isn’t like any normal&nbsp;
guidance teacher, she was also bullied in school&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:17.600
and knows how it feels like to be weak. Hence, she&nbsp;
helps her students take revenge on the bullies.
&nbsp;

00:03:17.600 --> 00:03:22.000
Initially, she doesn’t seem to feel sorry for&nbsp;
Lisa. She makes her remember the events of the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:22.000 --> 00:03:27.440
night which in turn makes Lisa break down&nbsp;
crying. When she calms down, So-mi asks her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:27.440 --> 00:03:32.320
to be alive until she returns again.
On the day Lisa is being discharged,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:32.320 --> 00:03:37.840
she is visited by the leader of the bullies,&nbsp;
f. She has brought her new school uniform,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:37.840 --> 00:03:43.520
knowing that her old one is torn. The girl shows&nbsp;
no remorse for almost killing Lisa and tells her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:43.520 --> 00:03:48.880
she is better off dead. Before leaving, she&nbsp;
also threatens her to keep away from the police.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:48.880 --> 00:03:54.160
After she leaves, So-mi enters the room, having&nbsp;
heard all their conversation. She brings Lisa&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:54.160 --> 00:03:58.560
to her house and helps her settle in. After&nbsp;
that, Lisa goes to the neighborhood where her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:58.560 --> 00:04:02.960
mother used to live before her death. 
She is reminiscing about her past when a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:02.960 --> 00:04:08.800
passerby catches her attention. She follows the&nbsp;
girl and soon finds out she is her identical twin,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:08.800 --> 00:04:13.600
Jenny. Lisa tries to reunite with her&nbsp;
but Jenny walks away uninterested. 
&nbsp;

00:04:13.600 --> 00:04:17.440
It is revealed that the girls’ parents got&nbsp;
divorced before they were born. The couple&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:17.440 --> 00:04:23.200
was not on good terms, so the father never wanted&nbsp;
anything to do with Lisa and Jenny. But with time,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:23.200 --> 00:04:28.080
the mother’s financial condition got weaker.&nbsp;
Hence, she left Lisa at her fathers’ home&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:28.080 --> 00:04:33.360
and started living with Jenny. The sisters never&nbsp;
met after the incident and Lisa had to live with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:33.360 --> 00:04:38.720
her father who thought of her as a burden. 
The next day, So-mi follows Jenny to a convenience&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:38.720 --> 00:04:44.640
store and notices her shoplifting. She stops her&nbsp;
outside and asks her for help. Even when told&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:44.640 --> 00:04:50.160
that her sister was almost bullied to death, Jenny&nbsp;
remains uninterested in the conversation. She only&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:50.160 --> 00:04:55.680
agrees to help when So-mi offers her money. 
In the evening, the three meet at So-mi’s house.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:55.680 --> 00:05:00.720
She suggests they live together for a week or so&nbsp;
until the plan comes to a conclusion. Jenny is not&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:00.720 --> 00:05:06.240
a fan of the idea but agrees to do it anyway. But&nbsp;
then, she is told she will have to go to school as&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:06.240 --> 00:05:10.800
Lisa to teach the bullies a lesson. 
Jenny dropped out of school a year ago.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:10.800 --> 00:05:15.600
To her, no amount of money is worth going&nbsp;
to school again. She refuses to cooperate&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:15.600 --> 00:05:20.480
and storms off the apartment. A few minutes&nbsp;
later, she receives a video in a group chat.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:20.480 --> 00:05:25.840
The video is of Lisa getting bullied. A group of&nbsp;
girls tear her clothes, shove her to the ground,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:25.840 --> 00:05:30.640
and kick her repeatedly while a girl with&nbsp;
an obnoxious laugh films everything. 
&nbsp;

00:05:30.640 --> 00:05:34.960
This makes Jenny so mad that she returns&nbsp;
to the apartment and calls Lisa a coward.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:34.960 --> 00:05:40.560
The video reminds Lisa of the traumatic night and&nbsp;
makes her hyperventilate. Seeing her twin in such&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:40.560 --> 00:05:46.640
a condition, Jenny cannot help but feel bad for&nbsp;
her. With much determination, she asks So-mi where&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:46.640 --> 00:05:52.080
she can find the girl with the obnoxious laugh.
The following day, she goes to school as Lisa.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:52.080 --> 00:05:57.040
Her classmates notice the evident change in her&nbsp;
behavior but no one pays much attention to her.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:57.040 --> 00:06:02.720
That is until the group of bullies enters the&nbsp;
classroom. The bully Nayon excitedly sits on&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:02.720 --> 00:06:08.320
Jenny’s table and calls her cute for returning to&nbsp;
the school. Because of her laugh, Jenny realizes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:08.320 --> 00:06:12.960
that Nayeon is the girl in the video and the&nbsp;
one who made everyone else bully Lisa. 
&nbsp;

00:06:12.960 --> 00:06:17.280
When the bully starts getting handsy, Jenny&nbsp;
slaps her to the ground with a single blow.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:17.280 --> 00:06:23.040
She then grabs her by the hair and sits on top of&nbsp;
her, asking her to laugh again. Following that,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:23.040 --> 00:06:27.760
she shoots a video of her while choking her&nbsp;
simultaneously. Her friends of bullies can&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:27.760 --> 00:06:32.480
do nothing but retreat in fear. 
They only stop when Miss Lee interferes. She&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:32.480 --> 00:06:37.200
takes them to a private room to discipline them&nbsp;
but Jenny isn’t someone who obeys the teachers.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:37.200 --> 00:06:42.880
When she and Miss Lee are alone, she approaches&nbsp;
her with a pen, subtly threatening to stab her.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:42.880 --> 00:06:47.920
Miss Lee stammers in fear as Jenny calls&nbsp;
her out for being unfair to Lisa.
&nbsp;

00:06:47.920 --> 00:06:52.560
Later that day, Jenny returns home and shows&nbsp;
Lisa the video of Nayeon. Lisa doesn’t know&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:52.560 --> 00:06:56.720
how to feel about it because she doesn’t&nbsp;
support violence, even when it is projected&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:56.720 --> 00:07:02.000
towards her biggest bully. So-mi warns Jenny&nbsp;
to not do anything of such sort again because&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:02.000 --> 00:07:08.320
it might get her sister in trouble. 
The next day is the twins’ birthday.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:08.320 --> 00:07:12.960
They get themselves a cake and bond for the&nbsp;
first time in their lives. Lisa tells Jenny&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:12.960 --> 00:07:17.600
how hard her life has been because she never&nbsp;
got any kind of love from her parents. Jenny&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:17.600 --> 00:07:22.160
sympathizes with her since her life in poverty&nbsp;
with her mother has also not been ideal. 
&nbsp;

00:07:22.160 --> 00:07:26.160
The next morning, Jenny is asleep so&nbsp;
Lisa decides to go to school on her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:26.160 --> 00:07:31.440
own. She believes that since Nayeon was taught a&nbsp;
lesson, she won’t mess with her again. At school,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:31.440 --> 00:07:36.240
Nayeon’s mother is with the principal discussing&nbsp;
a way to transfer Lisa to another school. The&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:36.240 --> 00:07:40.320
woman is afraid that she will try to take&nbsp;
revenge on her daughter and wants her gone as&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:40.320 --> 00:07:46.480
soon as possible. A corrupt principal assures&nbsp;
her to take care of the situation. Meanwhile,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:46.480 --> 00:07:51.920
Lisa overhears their conversation from the&nbsp;
doorway and runs to the bathroom in tears. There,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:51.920 --> 00:07:57.360
she bumps into Nayeon before locking herself&nbsp;
inside a stall. Nayeon, who has been wanting to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:57.360 --> 00:08:04.640
take revenge, dumps a bucket of water on her.
Lisa returns home wet and falls to the ground in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:04.640 --> 00:08:11.200
exhaustion. So-mi helps her while Jenny glows&nbsp;
red in anger. She immediately calls Nayeon&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:11.200 --> 00:08:14.400
and asks her to come to the mountain&nbsp;
if she doesn’t want the video of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:14.400 --> 00:08:19.120
her beating up Lisa on the internet. 
Scared to be convicted of bullying, Nayeon&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:19.120 --> 00:08:24.160
does as told. When she reaches the mountain,&nbsp;
Jenny hits her on the head and knocks her out.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:24.160 --> 00:08:29.600
On regaining consciousness, her hands and&nbsp;
legs are tied and her mouth is taped. 
&nbsp;

00:08:29.600 --> 00:08:34.560
Jenny removes the tape from her mouth and&nbsp;
forcefully makes her drink a full bottle of water.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:34.560 --> 00:08:41.040
Then, she brings out another bottle filled with&nbsp;
acid. Nayeon cries for her life which only makes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:41.040 --> 00:08:48.400
Jenny laugh harder. She pours the acid dangerously&nbsp;
close to her face but promises to not kill her.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:48.400 --> 00:08:54.720
By now, Nayeon can hardly breathe and is crying&nbsp;
hysterically. Jenny unties her legs and asks her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:54.720 --> 00:09:00.720
to run away if she wants to stay alive. The bully&nbsp;
takes the chance but falls a few meters away. 
&nbsp;

00:09:00.720 --> 00:09:05.440
Just then, Lisa arrives at the scene and tries&nbsp;
to free Nayeon because she doesn’t want any&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:05.440 --> 00:09:10.640
more people to get hurt. Seconds later, So-mi&nbsp;
follows behind and is shocked at the scene.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:10.640 --> 00:09:14.560
She scolds Jenny for losing her temper&nbsp;
and calls an ambulance for Nayeon. 
&nbsp;

00:09:14.560 --> 00:09:18.240
In the following scene, Jenny is&nbsp;
getting interrogated by the police.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:18.240 --> 00:09:24.640
Since no one saw her with the victim, she is only&nbsp;
a suspect. So-mi arrives and asks the officers&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:24.640 --> 00:09:29.440
to let her go for the time being. The officers&nbsp;
decide to wait until Nayeon gains consciousness&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:29.440 --> 00:09:34.720
and lets them go. Outside, Jenny claims that&nbsp;
she does not regret her actions to the least&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:34.720 --> 00:09:40.000
and would do it again if she had the chance. 
A disappointed So-mi leaves her alone and returns&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:40.000 --> 00:09:45.680
home. Right after, Nayeon’s mother attacks&nbsp;
Jenny calling her names. Jenny smugly mocks&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:45.680 --> 00:09:51.200
the lady and asks her to laugh like her daughter.&nbsp;
While arguing, she also slips that what she did&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:51.200 --> 00:09:56.800
was only a payback. The officers realize she&nbsp;
is in fact the culprit. When Mr. Kim calls&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:56.800 --> 00:10:02.480
her by Lisa’s name, she lashes out and claims&nbsp;
that the Lisa he is looking for is at home.
&nbsp;

00:10:02.480 --> 00:10:08.400
Later, Mr. Kim and his fellow officer are driving&nbsp;
back home but Kim cannot get the thought of Jenny&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:08.400 --> 00:10:12.880
out of his mind. He has also noticed a significant&nbsp;
change in her behavior since she was in the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:12.880 --> 00:10:18.000
hospital. Suspecting that she has a doppelganger,&nbsp;
he drives to her house to check. However,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:18.000 --> 00:10:23.600
on reaching the place, he finds it empty. Just&nbsp;
then, he gets a call from the hospital, informing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:23.600 --> 00:10:28.160
him that Nayeon has gained consciousness. 
She is blabbering about someone else being in the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:28.160 --> 00:10:33.600
scene when she was attacked. A flashback shows&nbsp;
us that Jenny was alone when Nayeon was laying&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:33.600 --> 00:10:41.520
on the ground in the mountains. In fact, Jenny,&nbsp;
Lisa, and So-mi are all the same person. Till now,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:41.520 --> 00:10:47.280
every time Lisa was talking to either of them, she&nbsp;
was only talking to herself. She never had a twin&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:47.280 --> 00:10:52.720
sister. After being bullied, she was so alone&nbsp;
and stranded that she fantasized about having&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:52.720 --> 00:10:58.080
someone who cared for her. Soon, the fantasy&nbsp;
changed into obsessiveness and she developed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:58.080 --> 00:11:02.720
a multiple personality disorder. Meanwhile, So-mi&nbsp;
is an actual person. She is a guidance officer&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:02.720 --> 00:11:07.840
and the only person who helped Lisa. But&nbsp;
she never met Lisa at the hospital. Lisa&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:07.840 --> 00:11:13.120
imagined her being there to tackle loneliness&nbsp;
and eventually added her to her personality. 
&nbsp;

00:11:13.120 --> 00:11:17.920
The court finds out what exactly is wrong with&nbsp;
Lisa and she ends up in therapy. She drops out&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:17.920 --> 00:11:22.640
of school and focuses on her mental health. We&nbsp;
see a clip of her talking to a therapist about&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:22.640 --> 00:11:29.520
her past trauma in great detail. She has finally&nbsp;
healed from it. In the last scene, the real So-mi&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:29.520 --> 00:11:34.800
drops her at the airport. Lisa is flying to&nbsp;
a different city to start a new life. 
&nbsp;

00:11:34.800 --> 00:11:38.000
Subscribe for more videos like&nbsp;
this, turn on the notification,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:38.000 --> 00:11:41.840
and leave a like to help the channel&nbsp;
out. Thanks for watching.

